1 World Championships, the 1982 World Sprints, and the 1981-82 European Championships. Later in 1980, she would break " [:a {:href "/athletes/80567"} "Tatyana Barabash"] "’s world record, recording 1:23.01 at Medeo in March."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button475417", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button475417').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Pair"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Time"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "200 m"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "600 m"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "2I"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/82078"} "Nataliya Petrusyova"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/URS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/URS.png"}] "URS"]] [:td {} "1:24.10"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "19.08"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "50.74"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "label label-default"} [:abbrev {:title "Olympic Record"} "OR"]]] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "2O"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/82114"} "Leah Poulos-Mueller"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "1:25.41"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "19.05"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "51.03"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "3O"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/80517"} "Sylvia Albrecht"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GDR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GDR.png"